    Deliberately does NOT import the repository root Directory.Build.targets, for the same reason
    Directory.Build.props here does not import its props: the smoke consumer must build the way a
    real consumer does. In particular the root file imports Frontier.Platform.Contracts' analyzer
    removal for projects in this repo; a consumer gets it only from the package's buildTransitive
    folder, and this sample is what proves that folder works.
  -->

